    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2RiZDVd8Fb6BcQM4DoVrfQ5)_\n\n## Commit 1: merge module headers, add Commentary and Code, drop `;;; Provide`\n- The first line of each module becomes `;;; sp-x.el --- Summary -*- lexical-binding: t; -*-` (the summary comes from the doc title, or from the module's own summary where it had one). The separate `;; sp-x.el` line is gone.\n- Every module gets `;;; Commentary:` with a short description at `;;`. Existing commentary text is kept; where there was none, it is the first sentences of the doc's description of the module.\n- Every module gets `;;; Code:` (modules that lacked it now have one).\n- The `;;; Provide` outline marker is removed from the docs and the `.el` files.\n- In the docs the header is one block under one heading.\n\n## Commit 2: outline comments follow the code\n- The first headings after `;;; Code:` start at `;;;;`, and a heading is at most one level below the one before it.\n- Outline-looking comments inside a form are plain `;;` comments (`sp-dired`) or moved to column 0 (`sp-org-id-link`, `sp-faces`).\n\n## Checks\nTangling the docs gives the same `.el` code as before; only comment lines change (checked by diffing the tangled output). The committed `.el` files match what the docs tangle to.\n\n## Not changed\n- `sp-torrent` (placeholder with no cookie) and `sp-org-custom-highlight` (no cookie, no header) have no `lexical-binding` cookie, so I did not add a header: that would change how they load.\n- The empty skeleton modules (`sp-mail`, `sp-syslinux`, …) are empty files in the repository, so only their docs changed.\n- Four headings in `sp-evil` sit inside a `(when sp-load-extras …)` form at column 0 (an outline heading must be at column 0); the stacked PR removes that guard.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01ACbiw1tHxZUgAEj5duertR",
